     "name": "Simon Holmstrom",
     "description": "With under two minutes remaining in the third period of a tied game, Simon Holmstrom nets his first career shorthanded game-winning goal which was his fourth shorty of the season. During the Ducks power play, Jean-Gabriel Pageau passes the puck over to Holmstrom who powers past Leo Carlsson and fires a beauty upstairs from a tough angle. Holmstrom, taking advantage of his time spent killing penalties, appears poised to further advance his development with the Islanders.\r\n\r\nOfficially Licensed Product of the NHL, NHLPA, and/or NHLAA. All copyright, logos, and marks are the property of their respective owners and are used, under license, by Sweet. All Rights Reserved. [Terms Apply](https://nhlbreakaway.com/terms).",
